From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roger Luethi <luethi@osism.tech>
Date: Fri, 5 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 24/24] glance: set python_interpreter for uwsgi

2026.1 runs glance-api under uWSGI. oslo.concurrency builds its prlimit
wrapper as [sys.executable, '-m', 'oslo_concurrency.prlimit', ...], and
under uWSGI sys.executable is the uwsgi binary rather than an
interpreter, so the command becomes

    uwsgi -m oslo_concurrency.prlimit --as=... -- qemu-img info ...

uwsgi parses -m as one of its own options and exits with "unable to load
configuration from oslo_concurrency.prlimit". qemu-img never runs, the
image_conversion import task fails, and the image is left stuck in
"queued" with nothing in the API response to say why.

glance already supports the fix: image_conversion passes
python_exec=CONF.wsgi.python_interpreter, and the option's own help text
names this exact case -- "in some situations (for example, uwsgi)
sys.executable may not actually point to a python interpreter and an
alternative value must be set". It is simply never set, so it defaults
to None and oslo.concurrency falls back to sys.executable.

Stock kolla does not hit this because it sets no image_import_plugins at
all, so image_conversion never runs. Deployments that enable conversion
do -- which on a Ceph backend is the normal configuration, since RBD
wants raw images for copy-on-write.

Known upstream since 2017 as https://bugs.launchpad.net/glance/+bug/1712463,
where the oslo.concurrency half was fixed in 3.25.0.

Signed-off-by: Roger Luethi <luethi@osism.tech>
---
 ansible/roles/glance/templates/glance-api.conf.j2 | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ansible/roles/glance/templates/glance-api.conf.j2 b/ansible/roles/glance/templates/glance-api.conf.j2
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/ansible/roles/glance/templates/glance-api.conf.j2
+++ b/ansible/roles/glance/templates/glance-api.conf.j2
@@ -86,6 +86,9 @@
 [oslo_middleware]
 enable_proxy_headers_parsing = true
 
+[wsgi]
+python_interpreter = /var/lib/kolla/venv/bin/python3
+
 [oslo_concurrency]
 lock_path = /var/lib/glance/tmp
 
